Package: anytable-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: AnyTable Team <maintainers@anytable.io>
Depends: systemd, udev
Suggests: ufw, xdg-utils
Description: Ultra-low-latency LAN remote desktop transmitter.
 AnyTable headless X11 capture, uinput/XTest input injection, and
 zero-overhead system tray settings daemon for ARM Ubuntu 18.04 LTS
 (arm64 and armhf, glibc 2.27 compatible).
